The Harrowgate Herald

SAFETY CORNER
151 days without a lost-time injury in the warehouse. Reminder: the rolling l=
adders in aisle 9 are tagged out until the new casters arrive.

HOUSEKEEPING
The break-room fridge will be cleaned out Friday at 3 p.m. Anything unlabeled=
 goes. Yes, including the mystery soup.

BIRTHDAYS
Happy birthday this month to Bonnie Szymanski, Luis Ferreira and Ted Halvorse=
n. Cake in the break room on the last Friday.

FROM THE PRESIDENT'S DESK
Thank you all for a strong year. Our fill rate stayed above 97% while we move=
d the bulk stainless line to the new racking.

